---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { config } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Paga aquí" description="Paga tu pedido SmokyBurger por Bre-B escaneando el código QR.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-lg px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:py-14">
    <div class="mb-6 flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FF5500]/10 text-[#FF5500]">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#FF5500]">Pagos Digitales (Bre-B)</p>
        <h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-4xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#F5F5F5]">Paga aquí</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[#A3A3A3]">Escanea el código QR para pagar tu pedido por <strong class="font-semibold text-[#F5F5F5]">Bre-B</strong>.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#181818] p-5 sm:p-6">
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-3">
        <Image
          src="/img/bree/Bree.jpg"
          alt="Código QR de pago Bre-B - SmokyBurger"
          title="Código QR de pago Bre-B"
          width={583}
          height={823}
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-sm object-contain"
        />
      </div>
      <ol class="mt-5 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-[#A3A3A3]">
        <li>Abre la app de tu banco y elige pagar con <strong class="font-medium text-[#F5F5F5]">Bre-B</strong>.</li>
        <li>Escanea este código QR.</li>
        <li>Confirma el valor de tu pedido.</li>
        <li>Envía el soporte de pago al WhatsApp <a class="font-semibold text-[#FF5500] underline decoration-[#FF5500]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#E04800]" href={`https://wa.me/${config.whatsappNumber}`}>{config.whatsappDisplay}</a>.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 text-center">
      <a href="/menu" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FF5500] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#E04800]">Ver menú</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
